        {
          "segment_id": "summary",
          "type": "summary",
          "source_text": "After the weather turns colder, a father quotes an old poem to tell his child that they can judge for themselves whether they feel warm or cold and decide how many summer quilts to use.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_summary_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:38+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "There are two kinds of parents. One is like your mom—she decides for you whether to use one quilt or two!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:40+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "The other is like me—I get both quilts out and let you decide for yourself.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:41+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:002",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "The quilts come in different thicknesses. The thin one is a lightweight summer quilt for air-conditioned rooms.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_note_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:44+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Which do you think is better—deciding for yourself or having your mom decide?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:45+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I'll use a thick one!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
